 "description": "<p>The lick-and-vibe pairing in egg form: nine licking modes and nine vibration modes share a rounded body that works externally at any point you place it. The egg shape is the feature — no handle, no angle to learn, just a smooth vibrating surface that rolls wherever contact is wanted.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_2_fb804fe0-aa61-4eb8-bf42-8c15a3dd5ca6_480x480.jpg?v=1692845037\"></p>\n<p>Below 50 decibels, the whisper-quiet tuning holds through the combined top settings, which is the number that separates usable-daily from occasion-only. The mute character is a design choice here, not a side effect.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_1_e0cdbcf5-5786-4a5c-8112-43773ef609c7_480x480.jpg?v=1692845060\"></p>\n<p>Full waterproofing covers bath play and rinse cleaning, and USB magnetic charging keeps the routine to two steps: dock, forget. Between the two nine-mode banks there is enough range for the egg to serve as a primary rather than a warm-up toy.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_3_6acca62f-f51d-465c-9c7a-22f83b3a80b6_480x480.jpg?v=1692845039\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Licking modes: 9</li>\n<li>Vibration modes: 9</li>\n<li>Noise: under 50 dB</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: fully sealed</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_4_499cac9f-c6b3-4a79-b551-316e5f292933_480x480.jpg?v=1692845042\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorrose_5_b7072aaf-0c8e-4742-a479-3c9a75924262_480x480.jpg?v=1692845045\"></p>\n<p>Eighteen modes in an egg shell — the shape-free shape, done thoroughly.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Vibrating rose egg with 9 licking and 9 vibration modes, whisper-quiet sub-50 dB motor, full waterproofing and USB magnetic charging.</p>\n",
